<title>HONG KONG: Henderson Inv year net up 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Henderson Inv year net up 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   72.0 vs 64.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    28.0 vs 25.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    1,893.27 vs 1,630.92</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,556.90 vs 2,213.98</p>
<p>    Company name		 Henderson Investment Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 30 to November 12</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 13</p>
<p>NOTE - Henderson Investment, an investment holding and property development company, is 66.01 percent owned by Henderson Land Development Co Ltd.</p>
<p>It was join the blue chip Hang Seng Index with effect from August 30, 1996.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is 41 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 13 cents) vs 36 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
